{"ts": "2026-11-19T18:20:58", "ticket": "T029", "status": "posted", "language": "de", "category": "question", "priority": "P4", "action": "reply", "faq_ids": ["F03"], "confidence": 0.93, "gates": [], "reason": "How-to for employees swapping shifts with each other; fully answered by F03, so reply.", "gloss": "Hello, your employees open the shift in the app and tap \"Ruil aanbieden\" (Offer swap). Colleagues with the same role can accept the swap. The manager approves it under Rooster → Verzoeken (Rota → Requests). Manager approval is on by default and can be turned off under Instellingen → Rooster (Settings → Rota). Team Roosterly", "retries": 0, "ms": 14517}
